      <p source="#source-244-273"><seg source="#source-244-273">雪解けの午後は淋し</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-273-299"><seg source="#source-273-299">砂利を噛む荷車の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-299-334"><seg source="#source-299-305">轍の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-305-317"><rb>音</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-317-334">遠くきこえ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-334-366"><seg source="#source-334-366">疲れ心地にふくみたる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-366-395"><seg source="#source-366-395">パイプの煙をのゝく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-395-427"><seg source="#source-395-427">室ぬちは冬の日うすれ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-427-477"><seg source="#source-427-477">描きさしのセント・セバスチアンは</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-477-503"><seg source="#source-477-503">低くためいきす。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-503-535"><seg source="#source-503-535">電燈のとぼるを待ちつ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-535-592"><seg source="#source-535-562">われは今　わが心の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-562-580"><rb>洞</rb><rt>うつろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-580-592">を眺む。</seg></p>
    </body>
